# vergeio_vm_recipes (Data Source)

Lists VM recipes and the questions each recipe asks at deploy time. `filter_name` keeps an exact recipe name. Set `catalog_id` or `catalog_name` to limit the list to one catalog. The same recipe name in two catalogs is two rows unless a catalog is set.

Pass `recipes[0].id` to [`vergeio_vm_recipe_instance`](../resources/vm_recipe_instance.md) as `recipe_id`. `questions` is in form order. `name` is the answers key. `type` `disksize` is bytes. `type` `bool` accepts `true`, `false`, `yes`, `no`, `on`, `off`, `1`, or `0`.

